      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T07:03:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually I\u0027m not even sure this is needed any more, because the FOREGROUND capability will already be set. Removed the TODO and uploaded aosp/2248453 to fix it.\n\nYour suggestion to have updateCapabilities return immediately if !everConnected seems good on the surface, but I think there are things in updateCapabilities that seem like they should run even if the network never connected. Examples are updateNetworkInfoForRoamingAndSuspended (though that code has historically been buggy before the network went into CONNECTED), propagateUnderlyingNetworkCapabilities, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "37947eb0_78092fe7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9163,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9165,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "64ac5758935af3f7898ec056806ff409725e6721",
