      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T07:03:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t actually use that method because it skips some updates if it sees that the LinkProperties haven\u0027t changed. As an example, it won\u0027t call networkAgent.clatd.update().\n\nThe reason I put this code here is that before this CL, updateLinkProperties was always called when a network went into CONNECTED state, and there is some code in updateLinkProperties that behaves differently depending on the NetworkInfo\u0027s state.\n\nI think I\u0027ll need to audit all the code in updateLinkProperties to enumerate all such instances, and figure out what to do about each of them.",
